    "regime_notes": "Full-history 5-day signal barely clears the absolute IC gate but has positive stability; recent windows are materially stronger. The 10-day and 20-day decay results are weaker or negative, so use only at the 5-day research horizon and interpret the 15-asset cross-section conservatively."
  },
